{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/cfe0091e7740da16b07add9d23b69843.avif?t=1774026585\" width=1024 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/bf3ee8b590b82e8f5329f5d1e2596e1e.poster.avif?t=1774026585\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/bf3ee8b590b82e8f5329f5d1e2596e1e.webm?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/bf3ee8b590b82e8f5329f5d1e2596e1e.mp4?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across four distinct zones inspired by Japan \u2014 <strong>Kamakura, Tokyo, Kyoto, and Shirakawa\u00a0</strong>\u2014 and clear handcrafted claw-machine levels to collect unique prizes, unlock hidden stories, and restore a charming miniature world piece by piece.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/46551893c961e06161d865df1267a1c3.avif?t=1774026585\" width=1024 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/7c0af3b4d7b7bf7fbac4df52b37f0046.poster.avif?t=1774026585\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/7c0af3b4d7b7bf7fbac4df52b37f0046.webm?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/7c0af3b4d7b7bf7fbac4df52b37f0046.mp4?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the figures and objects you unlock, experiment with charming arrangements, and personalize each diorama piece by piece. Decoration is not just a reward \u2014 it is part of the heart of <strong>Clawsome</strong>, turning every successful grab into something you can keep, display, and make your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/0ba86fc96fb9044b796fd90c8a4c3eb2.avif?t=1774026585\" width=1024 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b77efd8a663ffe18ad5b38f1bafe8ae5.poster.avif?t=1774026585\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b77efd8a663ffe18ad5b38f1bafe8ae5.webm?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b77efd8a663ffe18ad5b38f1bafe8ae5.mp4?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a handcrafted claw-machine board with its own objectives, surprises, and physical interactions. Catch the right prizes, experiment with the environment, and solve challenges to move forward through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions ask you to rescue or collect specific characters, while others hide their true solution behind level interactions, funny situations, or puzzles that are not visible at first glance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/431203ad8f7ee815a82da57f50c59b3f.avif?t=1774026585\" width=1024 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/762d10a63c3e7dce50576e8bf471824e.poster.avif?t=1774026585\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/762d10a63c3e7dce50576e8bf471824e.webm?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/762d10a63c3e7dce50576e8bf471824e.mp4?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy lighthearted challenges, charming collectibles, and a touch of mayhem, Clawsome is the perfect game for you with a mix of cozy vibes and unpredictable fun. Test your skills in the most delightful grabber game ever!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/590081de9d2b739be2d03d54ad075f36.poster.avif?t=1774026585\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/590081de9d2b739be2d03d54ad075f36.webm?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/590081de9d2b739be2d03d54ad075f36.mp4?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Each grab will bring you endless excitement!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.st