ss four distinct zones inspired by Japan \u2014 <strong>Kamakura, Tokyo, Kyoto, and Shirakawa\u00a0</strong>\u2014 and clear handcrafted claw-machine levels to collect unique prizes, unlock hidden stories, and restore a charming miniature world piece by piece.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/46551893c961e06161d865df1267a1c3.avif?t=1774026585\" width=1024 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/7c0af3b4d7b7bf7fbac4df52b37f0046.poster.avif?t=1774026585\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/7c0af3b4d7b7bf7fbac4df52b37f0046.webm?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/7c0af3b4d7b7bf7fbac4df52b37f0046.mp4?t=1774026585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the figures and objects you unlock, experiment with charming arrangements, and personalize each diorama piece by piece. Decoration is not just a reward \u2014 it is part of the heart of <strong>Clawsome</strong>, turning every successful grab into something you can keep, display, and make your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/0ba86fc96fb9044b796fd90c8a4c3eb2.avif?t=1774026585\" width=1024 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880